# Normalizes line endings for scripts/config copied into the Docker image
# (CLAUDE.md rule 4) -- a script checked out with CRLF on a Windows clone
# would otherwise fail inside the Linux-based container with a cryptic
# "no such file or directory" (the shebang line's \r isn't stripped).
* text=auto eol=lf

*.py text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
